    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορῐ-άλωτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>captive of the spear, taken in
				war,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.74
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				9.4
			</span></i>; of persons, <i>captive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				518
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.177
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεις</span> Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.181
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				23.10.6
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουριάλωτον</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχος,</span> of Tecmessa, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				211
			</span></i> (lyr.): —<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορυάλωτος</span> is a freq. v.l., as in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.526
			</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1293.57
			</span></i>.</div>
